      "comment": "Nameless Bard: The Last Song",
      "content": "In A Note in Spring's Leich, the Nameless Bard strums the strings of the Master of Time as Decarabian's rule collapses. A violent storm becomes a thousand-year poem of wind and colour, named Mondstadt, and 'all who hold freedom in their hearts are its musicians'. His body cannot bear a nation's song; it falls with the tower and his name is lost.",
