      "comment": "Nameless Bard: The Eagle's Feather",
      "content": "Venti obtained an eagle's feather for the boy who had never seen a bird. The boy died before he could receive it, and the feather stayed in the spirit's breast pocket as he watched Decarabian fall. Canon does not say whether this is why Venti's Anemo often appears as feathers.",
