        "rebellion against Decarabian"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Nameless Bard: The Rebels of Old Mondstadt",
      "content": "Item texts name five who stood before Decarabian's tower: a youth, a spirit, an archer, a knight and a flame-haired warrior. Amos' Bow lists a nameless young man, an elf and a knight with the huntress, while Freedom-Sworn adds the red-haired warrior as a fifth. The weak who could not climb sang the rebels' drinking song, which echoed through the city.",
