      "comment": "Nameless Bard: Venti's Face",
      "content": "Barbatos' first use of his new power, per Character Story 4, was to remake himself in the boy's likeness, so that he could play the lyre the boy loved. Venti says he took 'the form of a friend', comparing it to the false Stanley who borrowed another man's name, a parallel the quest does not spell out further.",
